  <h2>Henry Zhou</h2>
  <p><strong>Independent Dividend Researcher</strong></p>
  <p>I write about dividend stocks, ETFs, distribution histories, yield analysis, and long-term income planning. My work is focused on making public financial data easier to understand and verify.</p>
  <h2>How I Research</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Define the question, date range, and calculation basis.</li>
    <li>Check primary sources such as company filings, fund issuer documents, and SEC records.</li>
    <li>Record the data cutoff date and distinguish reported figures from calculations.</li>
    <li>Personally verify facts, sources, and calculations before publication.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Scope and Disclosure</h2>
  <p>I am an independent author and do not represent a brokerage, fund issuer, or financial institution. Dividend Guide provides educational information only and does not provide personalized investment, tax, or legal advice.</p>
  <p>To report a factual correction, contact <a href="mailto:hello@dividend01.com">hello@dividend01.com</a> and include the article URL and supporting source.</p>
